{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Hochschild 同调"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Hochschild同调"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":"的 <strong>Hochschild 同调</strong>是其 “沿着流形 $S^1$ 的张量积”, 即 $S^1$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"分解同调","text":"分解同调"}},{"Plain":".\nHochschild 同调又叫 “"},{"Local":{"url":"迹","text":"迹"}},{"Plain":"”, “"},{"Local":{"url":"余中心","text":"余中心"}},{"Plain":"”.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"交换代数"}},{"Plain":"的 Hochschild 同调是其与"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" $S^1$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"张量积","text":"张量积"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>结合代数</h3>\n<p>设 $\\mathcal C$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"闭范畴","text":"闭"}},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":", $A$ 为 $\\mathcal C$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":". 定义其 <strong>Hochschild 同调</strong>为\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{HH}_*(A) := A \\otimes_{A\\otimes A^{\\mathrm{op}}} A.\r\n$$\n这个定义的缺陷是它没能反映 Hochschild 同调的 $S^1$-对称性.</p>\n<h3>交换代数</h3>\n<p>当 $A$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"交换代数"}},{"Plain":"时,\n有\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{HH}_*(A) =\r\nA\\otimes_{A\\otimes A}A = \\operatorname{colim}_{S^1}^{\\mathsf{CAlg}(\\mathcal C)} A = A^{\\otimes S^1}.\r\n$$\n有典范的态射\n$$\r\nA \\to\\mathrm {HH}^*(A),\r\n$$\n它是 $A$ 到 $S^1$-作用的"},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"交换代数"}},{"Plain":"的万有态射, 是"},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"交换代数"}},{"Plain":"的范畴中 $S^1$ 形状的常值图 $A$ 的余极限, 也是 $A\\colon *\\to \\mathsf {CAlg}(\\mathcal C)$ 沿 $*\\to \\mathbf{B}S^1$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"Kan扩张","text":"左 Kan 扩张"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>而这个余极限 $\\operatorname{colim}_{S^1}^{\\mathsf{CAlg}(\\mathcal C)} A$ 由于 $S^1=*\\sqcup_{*\\sqcup *}*$, 可计算为\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\mathrm {HH}_*(A) &amp;= \\operatorname{colim}_* A \\otimes_{\\operatorname{colim}_{*\\sqcup *}A}\\operatorname{colim}_* A\\\\\r\n&amp; = A\\otimes_{A\\otimes A}A.\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p>记 $X = \\operatorname{Spec} A$, 那么作为"},{"Local":{"url":"导出概形","text":"导出概形"}},{"Plain":"有\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Spec}(\\operatorname{HH}_*(A)) = X\\times_{X\\times X} X = X^{S^1} = \\mathcal LX,\r\n$$\n即为 $X$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"自由环路空间","text":"自由环路空间"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal L X$.</p>\n<h3>范畴</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"紧生成范畴","text":"紧生成范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 的 Hochschild 同调可定义为如下单纯对象的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现","text":"几何实现"}},{"Plain":":</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>与 K-理论的关系</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>THH and TC are in practice computationally useful approximations to K</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Hochschild上同调","text":"Hochschild 上同调"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}